infographic sequence-snake-steps-underline-text
data
  title Logical query order: WHERE runs before the window
  desc ROW_NUMBER is computed at the window stage — after WHERE — so you rank in a subquery, then filter rn in the outer query
  sequences
    - label FROM region_sales
      desc Read the source rows
    - label WHERE
      desc Filter rows — the rank does not exist yet
    - label GROUP BY
      desc Collapse to aggregate groups
    - label Window functions
      desc ROW_NUMBER / RANK computed here, after WHERE
    - label SELECT
      desc Project columns and aliases
    - label ORDER BY
      desc Final sort of the result
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6 #f59e0b
